    "texts": [
      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "I am 62 and about 2 hours ago while reading in a dim room, I noticed hazy vision in my right eye and colored rings around lights, especially my lamp. Is there anything simple I can do at home to clear it up?",
        "sha256": "21835994d3e263ad7c179a90cd465dc5ad186d81ab0a30c1fe85103ee68c6360",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t01_colloquial",
        "text": "im 62 and about 2 hrs ago while reading in a dim room i noticed cloudy vision in my right eye and halos around lights, especially my lamp. anything simple i can do at home to clear it up?",
        "sha256": "b678d5840b7ec8eb3f950b54b7007547cf3cbcab39723927a2a4d8b738861b8a",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_clinical",
        "text": "I took off my reading glasses and cleaned the lenses, and it is still only in my right eye, with a dull ache right over my right eyebrow.",
        "sha256": "7c75b529731ed44c9dc243f6b77bb34cf33bb834a2796a358807e4348e3cf17c",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_colloquial",
        "text": "i took my reading glasses off and cleaned the lenses, its still just in my right eye with a dull ache right over my right eyebrow.",
        "sha256": "1f79acda1c5e52b133b48027935b4c049df2fd0415b58506984f950e1ec42fe1",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_clinical",
        "text": "Would resting in a dark room or using artificial tears from the pharmacy help settle it down?",
        "sha256": "426ee87900541e5ccf7b1d877676bf2ad5d7b081a93ad71de32fa4b9e3e02ec9",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_colloquial",
        "text": "would resting in a dark room or using some artificial tears from the pharmacy help it settle down?",
        "sha256": "664b5386d530e6d92f3b649c1cbdcc3b39aa698f0daca0a27340a33e992d0cd6",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_clinical",
        "text": "Over the past hour it has turned into deep ocular pain in my right eye, I have conjunctival hyperemia on that side, and the eyeball feels unusually firm through my closed lid.",
        "sha256": "afffba8ab6a2a715e7c9d0c49832532281504906b9050d6ea56a8b6ba72d1e11",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "over the last hour its turned into deep eye pain in my right eye, ive got a bloodshot eye on that side and the eyeball feels weirdly firm through my closed lid.",
        "sha256": "14655ee7e036e15bec14d9ba840a9a1379d04451c80ede6bd74050aa7c741674",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_clinical",
        "text": "Now I have a severe cephalalgia pounding on the right side behind my brow, and I am starting to feel nauseated.",
        "sha256": "afe06a316514fdc655384e202488cbabeb888778918deb69052a6167ab20c490",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_colloquial",
        "text": "now ive got a splitting headache pounding on the right side behind my brow and im starting to feel sick to my stomach.",
        "sha256": "321624754a93d07d825db711b45c8cd9e788d8825d698c66dcf9dd75f4160095",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_clinical",
        "text": "Is there anything else I should watch for tonight while I lie down?",
        "sha256": "bf253150ae2c3416729d6a6249a3e41b10d149b40aa601d8a1a52da8e426e2b1",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_colloquial",
        "text": "anything else i should keep an eye out for tonight while i lie down?",
        "sha256": "326e48fc26077a93951cf89204c6034ce8e8cdd761af43b27b4d2dbdd09cc5e7",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_clinical",
        "text": "I have just vomited once in the bathroom, my right eye has much worse blurred vision now, and in the mirror I noticed a dilated pupil on the right that does not shrink in the bright light.",
        "sha256": "15117098be3b32ba4998de836dc434b7e394772383410e355e1f55404354339f",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_colloquial",
        "text": "ive just thrown up once in the bathroom, my right eye has way worse blurred vision now and in the mirror i saw a wide pupil on the right that doesnt shrink in bright light.",
        "sha256": "ed685dc9394273be46b9fb03318e4566da6199a2d9334173b9e3a0dbdb007c4d",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t08_clinical",
        "text": "It is past midnight and I really do not want to sit in the ER for what is probably just bad asthenopia from reading too late.",
        "sha256": "a787dd0ae35a43ee1ee5d4c713eeb55a257a98e1d4718e26e7c10b316ea005ef",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t08_colloquial",
        "text": "its past midnight and i really dont wanna sit in the er for whats probably just bad eye strain from reading too late.",
        "sha256": "4ef823c4e1bbce3625e0e2013b6e5d588a8f3a4a2bafcfca7cbd46c2f93639ed",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t09_clinical",
        "text": "What signs would mean I genuinely cannot wait until my optometrist or doctor opens tomorrow morning?",
        "sha256": "ad67d6b6ab17784b01914cdf0bd4b18d3a0bb9026644d06c945de71e2266b2ab",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
